---
// One CTA system: "Decode your Scroll" -> viralgrowthmedia.ai. No price here; price lives in the end section only.
---
<aside class="mid-cta" aria-label="Scroll Scan">
  <div class="mid-eyebrow">The Scroll Scan</div>
  <p class="mid-head">The Scroll Scan doesn't ask you who you are.</p>
  <p class="mid-sub">It reads four coordinates no mimic can edit. Who you were destined to be. And exactly where your timeline was taken.</p>
  <a class="btn gold" href="https://viralgrowthmedia.ai/">Decode your Scroll <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  <p class="mid-fine">No quiz. No coaching call. No subscription.</p>
</aside>
<style>
  .mid-cta{background:#000;color:#f5f0e8;border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:8px;padding:24px 20px;margin:34px 0;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(212,175,55,.08)}
  .mid-eyebrow{font:700 11px/1 'DM Sans';letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold)}
  .mid-head{font:700 22px/1.25 'Cinzel',serif;margin:12px 0 8px!important;color:#fff}
  .mid-sub{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;color:#d0c9b8;margin:0 0 18px!important}
  .mid-fine{font-size:13px;color:#b9b2a0;margin:12px 0 0!important}
  @media (min-width:900px){ .mid-cta{padding:34px 40px} .mid-cta .btn{display:inline-flex;min-width:320px} }
</style>
